et is sighted no one can stop her purist and anyone who stands ageist her will feel the fiery wrath. When a Target moves fast she summons up her steed that as it moves faster and faster it looks more like a blazing inferno, Leaving a fire trail behind it<br /> <br /> * </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Merciless Gunman and Authorized works at written</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">* Speed: When using this rather then her moving faster it manifests are her summoning a horse with a fiery mien leaving trails of fire as it runs. </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 01-03-2017, 11:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}